<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Anomali Terdeteksi</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { 
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6; 
      color: #374151; 
      background: #f3f4f6;
    }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; }
    
    .header { 
      background: {{severityColor severity}}; 
      color: white; 
      padding: 30px 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
    }
    .header-icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .header p { font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.9; }
    
    .severity-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    
    .content { padding: 30px 20px; }
    
    .device-info {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .device-info h3 {
      color: #111827;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .device-info p {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    .metrics {
      display: table;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .metric {
      display: table-row;
    }
    .metric-cell {
      display: table-cell;
      padding: 15px;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      text-align: center;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .metric-cell:first-child {
      border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px;
      border-right: none;
    }
    .metric-cell:nth-child(2) {
      border-right: none;
    }
    .metric-cell:last-child {
      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
    }
    .metric-label { 
      color: #6b7280; 
      font-size: 11px; 
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    .metric-value { 
      font-size: 24px; 
      font-weight: 700; 
      color: #111827; 
    }
    .metric-unit {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .metric-deviation {
      color: {{severityColor severity}};
    }
    
    .details {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #111827;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    
    .cta {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .btn { 
      display: inline-block; 
      background: #3b82f6; 
      color: white !important; 
      padding: 14px 32px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #2563eb;
    }
    
    .footer { 
      padding: 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
      font-size: 12px; 
      color: #9ca3af;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #6b7280;
    }
    
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .metric-cell {
        display: block;
        border-radius: 0;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        margin-bottom: -1px;
      }
      .metric-cell:first-child {
        border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
      }
      .metric-cell:last-child {
        border-radius: 0 0 12px 12px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-icon">🚨</div>
      <h1>Anomali Terdeteksi</h1>
      <p>Sistem mendeteksi nilai yang tidak normal</p>
      <span class="severity-badge">{{severityLabel severity}}</span>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <div class="device-info">
        <h3>{{deviceName}}</h3>
        <p>Sensor: {{sensorName}}</p>
        <p>Owner: {{ownerName}}</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="metrics">
        <div class="metric">
          <div class="metric-cell">
            <div class="metric-label">Nilai Aktual</div>
            <div class="metric-value">{{formatNumber actualValue}}<span class="metric-unit"> {{unit}}</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-cell">
            <div class="metric-label">Nilai Prediksi</div>
            <div class="metric-value">{{formatNumber expectedValue}}<span class="metric-unit"> {{unit}}</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-cell">
            <div class="metric-label">Deviasi</div>
            <div class="metric-value metric-deviation">{{formatNumber deviationPercent}}%</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="details">
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">ID Anomali</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{anomalyId}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Device ID</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{deviceId}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Waktu Deteksi</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{formatDate detectedAt "datetime"}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">Lihat di Dashboard</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Email ini dikirim otomatis oleh sistem IoT PDAM.</p>
      <p>Untuk berhenti menerima notifikasi, silakan atur di <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}/settings">pengaturan akun</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
